       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ASSEMBLEIT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ASSEMBLEIT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MATE-GRAPH-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COLLISION-DEFENSE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ISOSTATIC-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ASSEMBLE-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ASSEMBLE-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-ASSEMBLEIT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PAS-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PAS-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MATE-AND-COLLISION.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ISOSTATIC-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PAS-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MATE-AND-COLLISION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MATE-GRAPH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COLLISION-DEFENSE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ISOSTATIC-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ISOSTATIC-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ASSEMBLE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PAS-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MATE-GRAPH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COLLISION-DEFENSE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ISOSTATIC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ASSEMBLE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ASSEMBLE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PAS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PAS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PAS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PAS-CODE.
